{"id":"573e576a0d47c877","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies.md","title":"Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology","display":"Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies","aliases":["14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies"],"display":"Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology","depends_on":["[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是其 Yoneda 嵌入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是候选 Grothendieck 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 在此定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(y(A),\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{J(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\forall J\\ (\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\to\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (J(C)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C))).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(y(A),\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{J(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\forall J\\ (\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\to\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (J(C)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C))).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies。次典范性表示所有表示预层为层。典范拓扑的存在不是任意拓扑族逐点并都仍为拓扑：此处可刻画为“任意箭头逆像之后，筛对所有表示预层的相容族都唯一可粘合”的筛，验证极大、稳定及局部性三公理；该刻画恰给上述并。小性保证候选拓扑族是集合，故并有定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(y(A),\\mathcal C,J),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{J(C)\\mid\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\forall J\\ (\\mathrm{IsSubcanonical}(J,\\mathcal C)\\to\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ (J(C)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C}(C))).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies|Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]]"},{"id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Can}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 为 [[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]] 的典范拓扑。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subcanonical-and-canonical-topologies|Definition — Subcanonical and Canonical Topology]]"}],"outgoing":["3fcbbf29a7947555","e21364f5dcced9e7","99b72d10a7d872f5"]}